{'symbol': 'SWKS', 'date': '2023-01-04 08:01:00', 'title': 'SKYWORKS FACILITATES FASTER CHARGING FOR ELECTRIC VEHICLES', 'text': "LAS VEGAS--( BUSINESS WIRE )--SKYWORKS SOLUTIONS, INC. (NASDAQ: SWKS), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE AVAILABILITY OF ITS NEXT-GENERATION SI89XX ISOLATED ANALOG AMPLIFIERS, VOLTAGE SENSORS AND DELTA-SIGMA MODULATOR (DSM) DEVICES TO IMPROVE CHARGING TIMES FOR ELECTRIC VEHICLES (EVS). SKYWORKS' NEW FAMILY, WHICH INCLUDES SI8921, SI893X AND SI894X, WILL HELP TO SHORTEN RECHARGE TIME FOR EVS. THIS LATEST PRODUCT LINE ALSO OFFERS BROADER INDUSTRY APPLICATIONS AND IMPROVEMENTS FOR SOLAR INVERTERS AND WIRELESS CHARGING."}